00:30:07,970 --> 00:30:10,470
the function calling convention.

913
00:30:10,470 --> 00:30:12,970
The function calling convention is fundamental.

914
00:30:12,970 --> 00:30:13,530
However,

915
00:30:13,530 --> 00:30:14,590
the operating system can, on top of that,

916
00:30:14,590 --> 00:30:15,270
on top of this function,

917
00:30:15,270 --> 00:30:16,750
on top of the function calling convention,

918
00:30:16,750 --> 00:30:17,770
on that foundation,

