00:30:30,670 --> 00:30:34,150
So we have a few rules,

926
00:30:34,150 --> 00:30:35,150
some rules.

927
00:30:35,150 --> 00:30:39,010
The general principles,

928
00:30:39,010 --> 00:30:40,870
