931
00:30:43,670 --> 00:30:46,210
The system call number.

932
00:30:46,210 --> 00:30:48,850
So what does the system call number mean?

933
00:30:48,850 --> 00:30:50,130
On this,

934
00:30:50,130 --> 00:30:51,770
let's come back and take a look.

935
00:30:51,770 --> 00:30:52,070
That is,

936
00:30:52,070 --> 00:30:55,990
