991
00:32:36,580 --> 00:32:38,300
We can use this argument

992
00:32:38,300 --> 00:32:40,300
to tell different system calls apart.

993
00:32:40,300 --> 00:32:41,840
As for the other arguments,

994
00:32:41,840 --> 00:32:42,740
a0 through a5,

995
00:32:42,740 --> 00:32:44,780
